<a id="rechain"></a>
# Rechain: State and Recorded History

## The Stack: reading order

These three lessons explain one application from local state changes to transport and durable workflows:

1. [Rechain](rechain.md#rechain): reducers, atomic dispatch, recorded history, archives and verified reads.
2. [Reactor](reactor.md#reactor): typed endpoints, batched delivery, scheduling, results and events.
3. [Takt](takt.md#takt): typed workflow graphs, decisions, parallel work, recovery and inspection.

The [combined reference](thestack.md) is these three files concatenated in that order.

